  36:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****       (#) As prerequisite, fill in the HAL_QSPI_MspInit() :
  37:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (++) Enable QuadSPI clock interface with __HAL_RCC_QSPI_CLK_ENABLE().
  38:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (++) Reset QuadSPI Peripheral with __HAL_RCC_QSPI_FORCE_RESET() and __HAL_RCC_QSPI_RELEASE_
  39:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (++) Enable the clocks for the QuadSPI GPIOS with __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE().
  40:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (++) Configure these QuadSPI pins in alternate mode using HAL_GPIO_Init().
  41:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (++) If interrupt mode is used, enable and configure QuadSPI global
  42:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****             interrupt with HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() and HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
  43:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (++) If DMA mode is used, enable the clocks for the QuadSPI MDMA
  44:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****             with __HAL_RCC_MDMA_CLK_ENABLE(), configure MDMA with HAL_MDMA_Init(),
  45:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****             link it with QuadSPI handle using __HAL_LINKDMA(), enable and configure
  46:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****             MDMA global interrupt with HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() and HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
  47:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****       (#) Configure the flash size, the clock prescaler, the fifo threshold, the
  48:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_qspi.c ****           clock mode, the sample shifting and the CS high time using the HAL_QSPI_Init() function.
